{"product":{"id":9728670171361,"title":"WOODSMAN 92","body_html":"<p>The Woodsman 92 is our hard-snow directional ski: a 92mm all-mountain platform built to carve clean and hold speed on firm snow.</p>\n<p>For 26/27, the Woodsman 92 receives an updated flex profile that is stiffer underfoot and through the forebody. This adds torsional stiffness for better edge hold and more stability at speed. Ripper Rocker puts more edge on the snow with shorter tip and tail rocker and higher camber. The balanced Bi-Radius Sidecut bites early in the tip and drives through the tail for a strong turn exit. A directional mount and supportive tail reward skiers who drive the front of the ski both down and across the fall line. This is the Woodsman for groomers, hardpack, and the days when precision matters more than float.</p>\n<p>Every Woodsman 92 is built with our custom 2800 hybrid fiberglass/carbon composite, a 100% bamboo core, full-length UHMW sidewalls, and the thickest bases and edges in skiing. The result is a stable, powerful, and durable directional ski designed to take a beating.</p>","vendor":"ON3P","product_type":"Skis","created_at":"2026-09-15T20:21:47-07:00","handle":"woodsman-92","updated_at":"2026-09-24T12:40:41-07:00","published_at":"2026-09-20T14:30:49-07:00","template_suffix":"ski","published_scope":"global","tags":"26.27, Stock Ski, Woodsman","variants":[{"id":49128509964513,"product_id":9728670171361,"title":"171cm","price":"899.00","sku":"27ON3PWD92171","position":1,"inventory_policy":"deny","compare_at_price":"","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"171cm","option2":null,"option3":null,"created_at":"2026-09-15T20:21:48-07:00","updated_at":"2026-09-24T12:40:41-07:00","taxable":true,"barcode":null,"grams":0,"image_id":null,"weight":0,"weight_unit":"lb","inventory_quantity":4,"old_inventory_quantity":4,"requires_shipping":true,"quantity_rule":{"min":1,"max":null,"increment":1},"price_currency":"USD","compare_at_price_currency"